@LoginCheck_HostAddress = http://localhost:5012

### Weather Forecast
GET {{LoginCheck_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

### Register
POST {{LoginCheck_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userName": "alice",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### Login
POST {{LoginCheck_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}
